    "en": "Index of outlier"
  },
  "description": {
    "zh": "<p>三個相異整數中恰有一個與另兩個不同，輸出它的位置（1、2 或 3）。</p>",
    "en": "<p>Index of outlier.</p>"
  },
  "hint": {
    "zh": "找出與另外兩個都不相等的數。",
    "en": "Find the value unlike the other two."
  },
  "starterCode": "#include <iostream>\nusing namespace std;\n\nint main() {\n    \n    return 0;\n}\n",
